{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_10_22_openai_compatible_local_refinement_design", "label": "OpenAI-Compatible Local Transcript Refinement Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Goal: allow the local transcript refiner to use a llama-server (llama.cpp) instance on another machine (e.g. http://192.168.137.27:30000 serving unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF:UD-Q8_K_XL) while keeping Ollama as the default.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner", "label": "transcript_refiner module", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Local transcript refiner; currently posts to Ollama's native {TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_URL}/api/chat and the local provider ID is always 'ollama', saved as 'ollama:<model>' and shown as 'Local Ollama' in the UI.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__post_ollama_chat", "label": "_post_ollama_chat", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Posts to Ollama's native {TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_URL}/api/chat; llama-server does not provide that endpoint, which motivates the new OpenAI-compatible client.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__post_openai_compatible_chat", "label": "_post_openai_compatible_chat", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "New client added next to _post_ollama_chat: POST {TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_URL}/v1/chat/completions with Content-Type application/json and no auth header; payload has model, temperature 0, stream false, existing system/user messages, and response_format json_schema named 'transcript_refinement' using _OUTPUT_SCHEMA; reads content from choices[0].message.content (missing/non-string is invalid structured response); strips a leading think block before _parse_structured_response; HTTP errors report status code only, transport errors use _transport_failure_kind, messages use the 'Local OpenAI-compatible server' label and never include response bodies or transcript text.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__read_bounded_body", "label": "_read_bounded_body", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing bounded body reader; the OpenAI-compatible client reads its response with it and the configured timeout.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__parse_structured_response", "label": "_parse_structured_response", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing parser that already handles fenced JSON; called after removing a leading think block from OpenAI-compatible content.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__transport_failure_kind", "label": "_transport_failure_kind", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing helper classifying transport errors; reused by the OpenAI-compatible client for the same error handling as Ollama.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__refine_with_provider", "label": "_refine_with_provider", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Routes 'openai' to the new client with model TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_MODEL; unknown providers still raise ValueError. Per-chunk validation fallback (keeps source text for an invalid chunk) applies to both local providers instead of only 'ollama', and the warning log names the actual provider. Local-only runs and cloud-to-local fallback both use the configured local provider; the combined fallback error names the local provider label.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refiner__output_schema", "label": "_OUTPUT_SCHEMA", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing output schema embedded in the OpenAI request as response_format {\"type\": \"json_schema\", \"json_schema\": {\"name\": \"transcript_refinement\", \"schema\": _OUTPUT_SCHEMA}}.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "config_settings", "label": "config/settings.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Adds TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_API: 'ollama' (default, current behavior unchanged) or 'openai' (OpenAI-compatible chat completions). Value is trimmed and case-insensitive; any other value raises ValueError when settings load, naming the setting and the allowed values.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "config___init__", "label": "config/__init__.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exports the new TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_API setting from config/settings.py.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcription_core", "label": "transcription_core", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accepts 'openai' as a provider so the saved refinement method is 'openai:<model>'; historical 'ollama:<model>' methods remain unchanged and continue to show as 'Local Ollama'.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "app_pages_transcripts", "label": "app/pages/transcripts.py", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "UI page: the refine button, spinner, and disabled-state hint use the configured local label ('local Ollama' or 'local OpenAI-compatible server') instead of always saying Ollama.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "app_pages_transcripts__provider_caption", "label": "_provider_caption", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "_provider_caption('openai:<model>') returns 'Local OpenAI-compatible: <model>'.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "readme", "label": "README", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must document TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_API, add a llama-server example, and update the behavior list to describe local refinement through the configured local API. Privacy: the default remote example uses unencrypted HTTP on a LAN, so transcript text (not audio) crosses the network in clear text; the README's existing rule for non-local endpoints applies and documentation must restate that the endpoint must be trusted.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "env", "label": "user .env (not committed)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "User's local, uncommitted .env: TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_API=openai, TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_URL=http://192.168.137.27:30000, TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_MODEL=unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF:UD-Q8_K_XL, TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=300.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "llama_server", "label": "llama-server (llama.cpp)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "External llama.cpp server on another machine (e.g. http://192.168.137.27:30000) serving unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF:UD-Q8_K_XL; provides the OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions endpoint but not Ollama's native /api/chat.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "ollama", "label": "Ollama", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default local provider; provider ID 'ollama', saved in refinement methods as 'ollama:<model>' and shown as 'Local Ollama' in the UI.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "openai_compatible_api", "label": "OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions endpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chat completions endpoint provided by llama-server; response content is read from choices[0].message.content.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "ollama_native_api", "label": "Ollama native /api/chat endpoint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-22-openai-compatible-local-refinement-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ollama's native chat endpoint at {TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_URL}/api/chat, used by the current _post_ollama_chat; not provided by llama-server.", "metadata": {"graphify_reference_stub": true}, "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "transcript_refinement_api", "label": "TRANSCRIPT_REFINEMENT_API", "file_type": "concept", "so